                                "sense_id": "f0f61dfa-a9ed-3c0e-88cc-b2da25edf676",
                                "text": "\"You can't tell that the rings they're wearing are Claddaghs,\" Gerard said, \"but they are.\" He handed the picture to Regan. \"People don't really use the Claddagh rings as wedding bands anymore.\""
